/STAGE2 RUN TIME SYSTEM
/
/	THIS IS THE MACHINE DEPENDENT CODE PART OF STAGE2.
/	IT CONTAINS THE INITIAL SET UP AND INTERACTION WITH THE
/	OPERATING SYSTEM, I/O AND CLEAN-UP.
/	THE GET, STORE, MULTPLY AND DIVIDE ARE ALSO HERE
/
